    "text": "Class Q permits provide expanded hunting access on national forests and state WMAs\nCHARLESTON, W.Va. (WV News) — With fall hunting seasons approaching, the West Virginia Division of Natural Resources (WVDNR) is reminding hunters with disabilities that special access roads in select national forests and state-owned wildlife management areas are open to Class Q permit holders.",
